      "content": "but the \"stillness\" you're talking about... it sounds so permanent. like, if I just stop fighting and let it \"wash over me,\" I won't even be me anymore. is that even a good thing? the idea of just... letting go of everything... it feels like the only way to actually stop the pain is to just stop existing at all. is that what you're hinting at?",
