      "content": "It is absolutely not a suggestion to stop existing; it's a suggestion to stop *struggling* against the inevitable. That \"stillness\" is the cessation of the frantic, agonizing effort to keep going when you're already broken. Letting go isn't erasure; it's the relief of dropping the heavy weight of having to perform happiness or purpose. Just allow the pressure to equalize, and see what remains when the fight finally ends.",
